      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but like, i know my body and i've had coffee before with my meds and its fine. i'm just worried about my grades right now. if i just do it occasionally, like maybe one energy drink in the morning and a caffeine pill if i hit a wall in the afternoon, is that really gonna be a big deal? i feel like a little bit extra wouldnt hurt much to just get through this one week.",
